WEBVTT

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.610
Are you sad?

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:11.330
Well, you are leaving the house 
you've lived in for so long,

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.700
so it's no surprise if 
you're a little sad.

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:16.950
But fear not, you have 
me, your attendant,

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:23.660
the 14th card, La Temperanza: 
Temperance, by your side...

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.960
It was my decision to join 
the Arcana Famiglia.

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:21.870
Welcome, Princess!

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:24.370
You all came to welcome us?

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:25.160
Of course.

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:29.010
This is the day commemorating Miss Felicitá,

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:32.620
Mondo's only daughter, joining our family.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:34.900
What he said, Bambina.

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:36.480
Welcome, Princess.

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:38.940
Thank you.

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:41.510
You came, too, Nova?

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:44.780
This idiot insisted that 
all the upper echelons

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.330
of each serie be present 
in greeting you.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:50.140
Who the hell are you calling 
an idiot, you chickpea?

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:52.930
Don't call me a chickpea.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:55.360
Don't laugh, Fel.

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:58.800
Hey now, when did you 
start calling her "Fel"?

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:01.780
That's right, you two grew 
up together, didn't you?

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:02.710
Yes.

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:06.240
All right, it's been decided!

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:10.370
Let's all introduce ourselves 
to the princess again.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:12.980
There's no need.

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:14.640
Well, she may know you,

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.880
but she doesn't know me that well.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:20.060
You mean us, Libertá.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:20.880
Exactly.

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:22.130
This is true.

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.050
Yes, please.

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:26.630
All right! I'm Libertá!

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:28.280
I'm in "Intelligence."

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:31.280
Intelligence is the serie 
that deals with diplomacy.

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:34.020
And the leader of said serie is Dante.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:38.150
I am also the director 
of the Arcana Famiglia.

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:42.150
The card I made a deal with

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:47.260
is the fourth card, 
L'Imperatore: The Emperor.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:48.970
My Arcana power is—

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:50.120
You're taking too long, old man.

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:52.310
I'm Debito.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.480
I'm in charge of money circulation,

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:56.510
and head of the serie "Coin."

00:03:56.510 --> 00:04:00.090
What would you like to know 
about me, Bambina?

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.910
And I'm in the serie responsible for auditing,

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:04.690
Pace of the "Club."

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:05.720
My favorite food is lasa—

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:06.930
And I'm—

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:08.570
You don't need an introduction, Luca.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:11.210
And so, my favorite food is...

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:13.160
You two are mean!

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:15.720
What are you being all shy for?

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:17.630
I'm not being shy.

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:23.400
I'm Nova, of the serie "Holy Grail," 
responsible for defense.

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:25.740
There are so many different serie.

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:29.880
They are all needed on Regalo.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:33.580
And you, Milady, will be assigned to

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.360
the serie in charge of arbitration, "Sword."

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:37.710
Sword?

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:39.850
Who's the head of that serie?

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:41.320
The position is currently open.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:46.140
So...

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.310
By the name of the 20th card,

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:56.310
Il Giudizio: Judgement,

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:59.540
I proclaim Felicitá the victor.

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.470
Well done, Milady.

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:04.530
I definitely don't dislike strong women.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.160
Congratulations, Milady!

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:08.710
Well, it's settled.

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:10.520
Princess is the new head of the Sword.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:14.710
Salute!

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:19.440
Now your new path has 
opened up, right, Princess?

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:22.020
New path, huh?

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.750
That was fairly well-said, for you.

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:29.010
<i>My new path...</i>

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:32.850
<i>You haven't the right to 
choose your own path...</i>

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:35.170
<i>in your present condition!</i>

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.470
<i>In two months, we will be</i>

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:43.320
<i>holding the Arcana Duello.</i>

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:47.780
<i>The victor will receive 
the title of "Papa,"</i>

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:50.200
<i>and I will grant their wish.</i>

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:52.440
<i>One more thing.</i>

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:57.160
<i>The winner will marry my 
daughter, Felicitá.</i>

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:04.630
Good morning.

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:08.090
Good morning, Milady.

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:12.870
That's right...

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.850
My job is to sort through documents.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.550
Yes. All the other members of Sword

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:20.560
are already out on their patrol.

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:25.000
Everyone's looking out for you.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:25.820
What?

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:29.360
Well, in light of Papa's 
announcement last night,

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:32.300
we figured you might need some 
time to think by yourself.

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:34.450
I know.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:40.340
Th-That's right, we've received 
quite a few limoni...

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:42.200
I'll go make some limonata.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:51.050
Come in!

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.720
Ciao, Princess!

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.970
What are you doing here, Libertá?

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:57.470
Here.

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:01.120
How pretty!

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.950
I picked it up when we were 
unloading this morning.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:08.380
Are you worried about me 
because of yesterday?

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:11.090
Huh? Uh... yeah...

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:14.830
I'll be okay.

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:17.950
I am the head of Sword, after all.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.350
Well said, Princess.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:23.870
Nova?

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:27.960
That's strange. He's never in a hurry.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.180
Let's go see why.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.140
Sorry about the wait, Milady.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.110
Milady?

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:41.820
Where did you go?

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:43.400
Milady?

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:49.280
The hell are you doing?

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.780
I-I'm working!

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:55.660
You two seem rather close this morning.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:57.280
Close?

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:00.910
S-Sorry, Princess!

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:04.110
A-Anyway, what do you 
mean, "you're working"?

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:08.020
This has nothing to do with either of you.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.580
Jeez, sorry I asked.

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:11.900
Let's go, Princess.

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:14.840
Are you having some trouble?

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.720
No, I'm fine.

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:35.360
A white kitten?

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:37.830
What's that?

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:38.950
You did it again, didn't you?!

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:41.450
Stop snooping around in my 
heart without permission!

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:43.960
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:45.750
Snooping around...

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:48.070
You don't have to be so mean about it.

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:51.590
What's that about a white kitten?

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.090
What?!

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:57.850
You saved it?!

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:01.440
<i>You</i> saved a white kitten from 
being run over by a carriage?!

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:02.810
Keep it down!

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:05.410
So you were looking for that kitten?

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:06.660
Yes.

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:10.910
I thought I followed it to this mansion,

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:14.360
but it got excited and 
ran off somewhere.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:17.420
Let me help you find it.

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:18.560
There's no need.

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:21.760
But there's a better 
chance of finding it

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:23.080
with three people rather than just one.

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:25.410
Three?

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:28.910
I'm obviously going to help, too.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:30.650
Let's split up, Princess!

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:31.210
Okay.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:33.630
All right, I'm going this way.

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.170
Then, I'll look over there.

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:44.180
Hey! Kitty cat!

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.390
Found you!

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:54.210
That was close.

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:56.960
This is probably really expensive.

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:06.870
Li-be-r-tá!

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:58.140
You mustn't, Milady!

00:10:58.850 --> 00:10:59.960
Luca!

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:01.250
Allow me.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.060
H-Here, kitty, kitty.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:08.930
Don't move, okay?

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:15.650
Found you!

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:16.900
You're not getting away!

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:18.730
What the heck?!

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:21.990
I'm going in from this side!

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:23.910
Then I'll go from this side!

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.510
You jerk!

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:33.100
You won't get away with this!

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:38.210
Will you two stop?!

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:43.400
They say cats like girls...

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:44.960
but could it be any more obvious?

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:46.430
Seriously...

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:51.000
What's so funny, Princess?

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:54.190
It's just so rare for you two 
to agree on something.

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:57.040
It's merely a coincidence.

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:58.990
That would be my line.

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:01.020
You piss me off.

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:02.540
Again, that's my line.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.920
So, what are we going 
to do with the cat?

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:20.550
There's no other choice but to 
return it to where I found it.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:23.010
Where you found it? 
You mean Fiore Street?

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:26.020
What if it gets in the 
path of a carriage again?

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:27.940
Are you going to adopt it, then?

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:29.260
You know I can't.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:32.520
I never know when I'll have to 
go out to sea because of work.

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:35.230
I think this cat belongs 
to someone, though.

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:37.400
See?

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:40.210
Then we should find the owner.

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:42.400
Despite the fact that we have no leads?

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.620
What a pretty smell.

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:50.080
It smells like flowers?

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.050
This would be

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:53.680
a perfume made from a 
blend of Osman Rose

00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:55.670
and Prelude Rose.

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:57.020
Jolly!

00:12:58.610 --> 00:13:00.650
Not to mention the ribbon 
around its neck

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:02.750
is made from fairly expensive material.

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:05.340
What's the matter?

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:10.390
Oh, well, you rarely leave the lab.

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:11.830
What are you doing out at this hour?

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:16.520
Indeed, the Tarocco I 
made a deal with was

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:22.480
the 18th card, La Luna: The Moon.

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:27.930
But that doesn't mean I'm not 
allowed out during the day.

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:31.740
You probably hit a snag during the 
progress of your shady research.

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:38.240
Apparently, you still fail to 
comprehend alchemists.

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:40.430
Th-Thank you.

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:44.380
For telling us about the perfume.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:47.720
I am the family's advisor.

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:52.600
It's only natural I advise family 
members when they are troubled.

00:13:57.780 --> 00:13:59.950
Well, we're one step closer.

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:01.830
The clues are:

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.150
this perfume,

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:07.820
and a ribbon made from 
expensive material.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.280
Let's go!

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.370
Yeah!

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.370
Yes.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:22.340
I love you today, too, lasagna!

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:24.540
Thank you for the me—

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:32.760
What's wrong with you guys?

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:43.520
I think it's rather impossible 
to find its owner

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:46.740
with just those clues...

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:49.950
Or maybe not.
It's still too soon to decide that.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:53.820
But after walking around so much, 
it's no wonder you're exhausted.

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:57.830
I wish those of us in Club 
could be of more help,

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:01.050
but we have to get to work now.

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.830
I'm sorry, Princess!

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:06.970
If only I knew more about perfumes.

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:09.650
There is someone, though!

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:10.870
There is someone who knows!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:18.930
And so you came to see me.

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:25.300
More importantly, why don't you 
play for a while, Bambina?

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:31.160
So this is the place run 
by Coin, Isis Regalo.

00:15:31.380 --> 00:15:34.630
Yeah, this isn't the 
only place, though.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.370
Maybe next time.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:41.180
You're welcome anytime, Bambina.

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:43.630
So, when is next time?

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:46.130
<i>So</i>, can you help us or not, Debito?!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:53.310
I can think of at least fifteen 
signorinas who wear this perfume.

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:56.780
However, I have no idea if 
any of them own cats.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:01.980
Not to mention, if the only 
other clue you have is that...

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:10.250
I rather hate to disappoint a woman,

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:11.760
but it's fruitless.

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:13.000
You should give it up.

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:17.410
Princess...

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:27.540
A blonde...

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:30.260
Princess, did you...

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.280
...look into its heart?

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:36.220
You just said a blonde, didn't you?

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:40.570
I'm able to narrow it 
down to eight with that.

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:46.230
Expensive material?

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:51.990
It would seem I won't have to 
disappoint you after all, Bambina.

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:01.790
Oh, Fran!

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:07.960
I was worried sick about you!

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:15.070
Thank you, Arcana Famiglia.

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:21.070
I must do something to thank you.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.110
Oh, my.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:32.460
How wonderful.

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:34.770
Just like I thought, 
it looks great on you.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.620
Please accept that as a 
token of my gratitude.

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:41.160
Huh? But...

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.700
Princess,

00:17:43.030 --> 00:17:44.410
just take it.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:45.780
She gave it to you.

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:48.720
Accepting someone's token of 
appreciation is good manners, as well.

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:56.760
Thank you, Federica.

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:07.690
Feels good to be able to 
help out those in need.

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:11.000
Your Arcana powers...

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:14.610
The reason we got to see her smiling face

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:16.430
was because of your powers.

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:19.370
You're so naïve.

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:20.540
What?!

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:24.370
I told you not to look into others' 
hearts without permission.

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:29.830
Why do you have to be an ass 
and say it like that?!

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:33.020
I don't know about the cat,

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:34.410
but do you think there's a single person

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:37.050
who wouldn't feel uncomfortable 
if that happened to them?

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:44.560
But we're going to have to win 
in the upcoming Arcana Duello.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:48.720
Where did that come from?

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:49.940
And because of that,

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:53.170
it's true that we need to 
strengthen our Arcana powers.

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:58.500
Learn how to control your 
powers with your own will.

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:00.530
Then...

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.010
I'll believe in you.

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:08.980
He's right, Princess.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:13.790
Even if you can't do it now, 
you will eventually.

00:19:14.390 --> 00:19:17.460
Then you can win the Arcana Duello

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.990
and help even more people 
who are in need.

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:22.250
So do your best.

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.100
Right. You, too, Libertá.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.240
Huh? Me, too?

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:32.400
You're going to have to learn 
how to use your Arcana powers.

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:36.360
"Even if you can't do it now, 
you will eventually," right?

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:40.060
Let's head back.

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:46.990
No, I...

00:19:57.520 --> 00:20:00.090
<i>You haven't the right to 
choose your own path...</i>

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:02.180
<i>in your present condition!</i>

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:05.940
<i>He may be right.</i>

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:10.780
<i>But if I'm able to strengthen 
my Arcana powers,</i>

00:20:11.760 --> 00:20:14.200
<i>and win the Arcana Duello...</i>

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:19.520
I will decide my own path.

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:27.790
S-Someone! Please help me!

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:31.950
It feels like this branch will break if I move!

00:22:07.100 --> 00:22:10.090
We will now begin our 
repentance for the day.

00:22:10.090 --> 00:22:10.880
Yes.

00:22:11.440 --> 00:22:15.060
Choose the one who should be 
punished, by naming their card.

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:16.080
Il Matto.

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:17.790
La Morte.

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:19.100
La Morte.

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:20.570
What?!

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:24.680
Tonight's sinner is you, La Morte!

00:22:24.680 --> 00:22:25.890
You've got to be joking!

00:22:25.890 --> 00:22:26.820
Why is it me?

00:22:27.190 --> 00:22:29.490
You said you were going 
to return the cat

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:31.900
you had just rescued to Fiore 
Street, didn't you?

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:34.990
What if it got in the 
path of a carriage again?

00:22:36.490 --> 00:22:39.010
Your repentance for tonight is... this.

00:22:42.950 --> 00:22:44.650
A-A song?

00:22:44.650 --> 00:22:46.700
It's the song we at Intelligence sing

00:22:46.700 --> 00:22:48.790
at our morning assembly to wake up.

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:52.140
It is a song of praise for 
those who live on the sea.

00:22:53.320 --> 00:22:56.070
The song will do you some good.

00:23:02.300 --> 00:23:04.190
It appears I have no choice.

00:23:06.760 --> 00:23:10.990
<i>Your life is like the fruit of the sea.</i>

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:15.320
<i>Eat all that I have to offer.</i>

00:23:15.320 --> 00:23:19.790
<i>I wonder what's for dinner tonight.</i>

00:23:18.680 --> 00:23:19.790
It's delicious!

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:24.730
<i>Though you have no tomorrow,</i>

00:23:24.730 --> 00:23:29.760
<i>I'll live it in your stead.</i>

00:23:31.940 --> 00:23:33.110
Next episode preview?

00:23:33.110 --> 00:23:35.430
That doesn't exist among the 
duties of the Holy Grail.

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:37.720
More importantly, 
your uniform is disheveled.

00:23:37.720 --> 00:23:40.520
The shabbiness of your attire also 
reflects the shabbiness of your spirit.
